                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\iota_n)
              respect the face and degeneracy maps on both sides and hence induce an inclusion of simplicial objects
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
